  "body_html": "<p>Welcome warm holiday cheer and natural beauty into your home with this lovely quilt set from Jeminise. Featuring a beautifully printed design of vibrant red cardinals perched among golden sunflowers, this bedspread brings a touch of cozy autumn and winter charm to any guest room, bedroom, or seasonal display. Perfect as a thoughtful holiday gift or a rustic addition to your own bedding collection, it offers lightweight warmth that is comfortable for year-round use, camping, or lounging.</p>\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Customizable Design:</strong> Personalize your quilt by choosing your preferred size, adding optional matching pillowcases, or adding custom name text for a truly unique gift.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Cozy Feel:</strong> Crafted with a breathable soft polyester outer layer and filled with high-quality silk floss for lightweight, consistent warmth in all seasons.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Highly functional as a bed quilt, cozy throw blanket, picnic mat, or travel blanket for camping and outdoor activities.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Offered in five convenient sizes including Throw (60x70 inches), Twin (68x86 inches), Full (80x90 inches), Queen (90x90 inches), and King (91x102 inches) to suit any bed or space.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Simple to clean and maintain; machine wash separately in cold water and air dry or tumble dry without heat to keep it fluffy and soft.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> Includes one high-quality printed quilt with the option to add matching pillowcases (20x30 inches) to complete your bedding set.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Product Specifications</h3>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Xmas Couple Red Bird</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Animal</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Bird</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Patchwork</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>Winter</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Throw/Twin/Full/Queen/King</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>1 text input</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
